// Ch6 B10 "The channel at dawn" (act1_ch06.md; W10 at dawn). In-engine. The party wades the shoal
// channel the barge came up. Yesterday's ash lies on the water in a flat grey skin, unbroken: nothing
// has stirred it. Tamsule's gilded signboards catch the sun on the horizon. ~30 words; it sets up Ch7
// without promising anything. The chapter flow hands off to ch07/tamsule at RiverMouth on black.
title: ch06_channel_dawn
location: ch06/brine_shoals
---
@camera W10_dawn
@music brine_shoals fade=2.0
@wait 2.5
Rhen [smile]: Tamsule. The Tidecup's on. #line:ch06_dawn_001
Liss [neutral]: You play? #line:ch06_dawn_002
Rhen [smile]: Everyone from the Reaches plays. #line:ch06_dawn_003
@wait 1.0
@fade out 1.5
===
